nre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I would like a beach art work of me and my vtuber friend @adorabunnybun in a pose like this is possible: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1H6R3Z3SMRdzagD8GKbXnXfxorMzXtwai/view?usp=sharing\n\n I am the pink kitty dragon Vtuber, I would like to be the one hugging her if possible.  Draw me in whatever bikini you feel is best. \n\nMy friend Adora is the orange octopus.  She would like a swimsuit like this, but a bikini version if that's ok: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DaJq15kIbuGjPsIdZ_U941er9yBz6NZ5\n\nBoth references for characters are in the folder linked below. Thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DaJq15kIbuGjPsIdZ_U941er9yBz6NZ5?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sensenonnon/works/5", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d760eff6/uploads/origins/a956992a-1e74-41ba-af03-f9ec979e8b93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34beadfaec1b2637956882fd77127973", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d760eff6/uploads/origins/a956992a-1e74-41ba-af03-f9ec979e8b93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=34beadfaec1b2637956882fd77127973, https://si.imgix.net/d760eff6/uploads/origins/a956992a-1e74-41ba-af03-f9ec979e8b93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f38aedae6a5707797325e2dc60c7cc97 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d760eff6/uploads/origins/a956992a-1e74-41ba-af03-f9ec979e8b93?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97855bffa74ef5f8600bdb24315b19ab 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "ののせさんこんにちは！\n私のVRchatで使用しているミントちゃんの改変アバターの水着イラストを描いてほしいです。\n水着は黒のスポーツビキニで、頭の上に丸いサングラスをかけた状態でお願いします。\nポーズはお任せします。\n資料用のURLを添付するので、ご確認ください。（サングラス差分あり）\nアバター元となる作者様のページはツイートのツリーにあります。ご参考にしてください。\n※注意点：アバター改変をしていて、目の色と髪の色が少しオリジナルと違うので、注意してください。\n\nhttps://twitter.com/zero_0sen/status/1525867116531961856", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sensenonnon/works/4", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/37e88be1/uploads/origins/e3be3c26-1b09-41c6-8bb9-5dfc0e9dcabf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f2ce4767c6cedcdeebcbe03c97eeac9", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/37e88be1/uploads/origins/e3be3c26-1b09-41c6-8bb9-5dfc0e9dcabf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f2ce4767c6cedcdeebcbe03c97eeac9, https://si.imgix.net/37e88be1/uploads/origins/e3be3c26-1b09-41c6-8bb9-5dfc0e9dcabf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc46bbcbf082ba50410e8242b76fc67e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/37e88be1/uploads/origins/e3be3c26-1b09-41c6-8bb9-5dfc0e9dcabf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5cd8e697b5fef4664171199fe7f19213 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。あなたの水着アートを見て、とても気に入りました!私のVTuberキャラにこれと同じような水着を着せて依頼したいです！https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0091/6642/2094/products/product-image-1378078229.jpg?v=1605101073\n\nポーズについては、このようなものを希望します: https://wallpapercave.com/wp/wp5584588.jpg\n\nこれは私のキャラクターの参考シートです。彼女の名前は香森カンナで、人間の形をしたコウモリです： https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FSKQGERX0AAq9Q0?format=jpg&name=large\n\nこの作品は、夏の間、私のTwitterやTwitchで使いたいと考えています私の要求を考慮していただき、ありがとうございます。\n\n-カナ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sensenonnon/works/3", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/20c536d9/uploads/origins/5e22c793-2288-4004-bd85-5a4a378a1381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0bb25a77cc62447d0163cf04b1f982f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/20c536d9/uploads/origins/5e22c793-2288-4004-bd85-5a4a378a1381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e0bb25a77cc62447d0163cf04b1f982f, https://si.imgix.net/20c536d9/uploads/origins/5e22c793-2288-4004-bd85-5a4a378a1381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1dacf0fb6ec3d91f379320bfc518c8ec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/20c536d9/uploads/origins/5e22c793-2288-4004-bd85-5a4a378a1381?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=137b4d09f5b592446f8028d945463aef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello!\nI love your art so much and would love to get a piece of my character at the beach (in the ocean water) wearing a swimsuit! \n\nI’d like the pose/expression to look similar to this: https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/18/Character_Yelan_Card.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20220328100652\n\nI’d also like for the swimsuit to be inspired by this outfit but with the colors from my character sheet (without the scarf or engines): https://gamepress.gg/grandorder/sites/grandorder/files/2019-08/Okita%20J%20Souji%20Stage%201.png\n\nOverall, I’d like the piece to have a nice sexy feel to it!\nI plan to use this for Twitch and SNS if that’s okay! You’ll always be credited too!\n\nYou can feel free to be creative with the piece!! Thank you so much, and I look forward to seeing your work ^^\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1DBmYwOGoRlnEKC2qpgA8W4Fs3EQA2qVs", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sensenonnon/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/906e1487/uploads/origins/b96cfca1-a0b1-4526-ad18-b536d7ecea7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29b5306881560b841cd9a52312f2eac7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/906e1487/uploads/origins/b96cfca1-a0b1-4526-ad18-b536d7ecea7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29b5306881560b841cd9a52312f2eac7, https://si.imgix.net/906e1487/uploads/origins/b96cfca1-a0b1-4526-ad18-b536d7ecea7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e2af1449129d63a81bc12e884a6a89a8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/906e1487/uploads/origins/b96cfca1-a0b1-4526-ad18-b536d7ecea7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f8d07ac248510aee4025583036c1587 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたのアートはかわいいですね。私のキャラクターがビーチで水着を着ているアートをお願いします。帽子をかぶり、ジャケットを着ていますが、ジッパーを開けて水着を見せています。できれば、水鉄砲を持ってドヤ顔をしている姿がいいですね。お好みで、彼女にサングラスをプレゼントするのもいいでしょう。\n\nご検討いただきありがとうございました。\n\n参考： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nt_NKUn9oRA4LQicRPs2Tp5n_dHPcCO9?usp=sharing\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1nt_NKUn9oRA4LQicRPs2Tp5n_dHPcCO9?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@sensenonnon/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f2901c4d/uploads/origins/a480bf04-e903-457a-8144-0e5d8f7d29ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=597c04d4b17da21d67d4cc38ffc49b97", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f2901c4d/uploads/origins/a480bf04-e903-457a-8144-0e5d8f7d29ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=597c04d4b17da21d67d4cc38ffc49b97, https://si.imgix.net/f2901c4d/uploads/origins/a480bf04-e903-457a-8144-0e5d8f7d29ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1439822f71a37cbc982906a0fd5c7809 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f2901c4d/uploads/origins/a480bf04-e903-457a-8144-0e5d8f7d29ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=079e699d7b1e86883bbbad0b47bd8a39 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。宝鐘マリンが水着を着て、航空会社の救命胴衣を着ている絵をお願いします。ポーズや表情はお任せします。宜しくお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}